      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "Our probability-weighted outlook assigns a 50% chance to the \'Neutral Case,\' a 30% chance to the \'Bear Case,\' and a 20% chance to the \'Bull Case.\' The high weight on the neutral scenario reflects India\'s inherent economic strengths against significant, but not catastrophic, external challenges. The substantial bear case probability underscores the unpredictable nature of geopolitical events and their potential for severe economic fallout. The lower bull case probability acknowledges the current global backdrop of elevated risks.",
