      bearCase: "The bearish case centers on the removal of a steady, price-insensitive institutional demand source without an immediate, equally powerful replacement. Should spot ETH ETFs face delays or rejection, or if broader market sentiment turns negative, ETH could experience increased selling pressure. The potential for Bitmine to liquidate staking rewards, however small, could also add to supply, creating a drag on price performance.",
