    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the complex dynamics of the cryptocurrency market. In the foreground, abstract data flows symbolizing institutional outflows from ETFs (depicted as downward arrows of light particles). In the mid-ground, a subtle, ethereal silhouette of a large whale shape emerging from deep digital waters, with a stream of Bitcoin logos moving from its position to a new, secure-looking digital vault. In the background, faint outlines of cityscapes with subtle Korean architectural elements, overlaid with a transparent digital screen showing \'Tax Delay?\' text. The overall mood is sophisticated, slightly uncertain but with elements of underlying strength, using a palette of cool blues, digital greens, and subtle golds. Avoid any literal depictions of specific company logos or direct exchanges. Focus on abstract representation of market forces.",
