      neutralCase: "The incident, while serious, primarily impacts a specific distribution channel (reseller CryptoBillis) and not Ledger\'s core security or direct sales. While there will be short-term negative sentiment and sales impact, Ledger\'s strong market position and brand loyalty, combined with enhanced security measures and user education, may allow it to recover over time. The fundamental demand for secure self-custody will likely persist.",
      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "Medium-term bearish, long-term neutral to slightly bullish. The immediate impact is negative due to trust erosion and financial losses. However, Ledger\'s response and the industry\'s focus on supply chain security could lead to stronger standards. There\'s a 60% chance of short-term negative impact on Ledger\'s sales and reputation, moving to a 40% chance of long-term recovery and potential market strengthening as security measures improve across the industry.",
