    outlook: "The immediate outlook for Bitcoin appears cautiously optimistic, underpinned by strong buyer support at critical price levels and increasing institutional engagement globally. While macroeconomic headwinds, particularly inflation and interest rate concerns, will continue to exert influence, the expanding regulatory clarity and adoption of ETFs in key Asian markets provide a bullish counter-narrative. The market will closely watch Bitcoin\'s ability to sustain momentum above $80,000 and challenge the $84,000 resistance. Long-term prospects remain strong, driven by continued decentralization and digital scarcity narratives.",
