    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a dynamic financial news desk. In the foreground, a professional news anchor gestures towards a large, transparent digital screen displaying a green-hued Bitcoin price chart showing a sharp upward rebound from a dip, with $80,000 highlighted as a key support level. In the background, muted screens show graphs of Asian stock market indices (e.g., MSCI Asia Pacific, KOSPI) also showing upward trends. The overall atmosphere should be professional, urgent, and data-driven, with subtle glowing lines connecting Bitcoin to global markets. Use a realistic, high-resolution style with depth of field.",
