      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "The outlook is moderately bearish in the short term, with a 50% probability of continued volatility influenced by macro data and tech sector jitters, 30% probability of further downside if CPI is unfavorable or AI concerns escalate, and 20% probability of a bullish rebound driven by unexpected positive news or strong institutional inflows. The long-term outlook remains cautiously optimistic due to ongoing innovation and institutional interest.",
