      tokenOverview: "This article covers multiple cryptocurrencies and protocols. Bitcoin (BTC) and Ether (ETH) are the two largest cryptocurrencies by market capitalization, often serving as bellwethers for the broader crypto market. The Ethereum Name Service (ENS) is a decentralized naming system built on Ethereum, providing human-readable names for blockchain addresses and resources. USDT (Tether) is a stablecoin pegged to the U.S. dollar.",
